<!DOCTYPE html>
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dashboard Layout</title>
  <!-- Material Icons for the sidebar and card actions -->
  <link href="https://googleapis.com" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* Global Reset & Base Styles */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
      background-color: #e2e8f0;
      color: #1e293b;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Main Page Grid Layout */
    .container {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: 150px 1fr;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    /* 1. Sidebar Styles */
    .sidebar {
      background-color: #1a8ad2;
      color: white;
      grid-row: 1 / -1;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .nav-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .nav-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 0.25rem 0;
    }
    .nav-item:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /* 2. Header Styles */
    .header {
      background-color: white;
      grid-column: 2 / -1;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1rem 3rem;
      z-index: 10;
    }
    .header-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .search-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background-color: #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
      width: 60%;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .search-bar input {
      border: none;
      background: none;
      outline: none;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .header-profile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .header-bottom {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .user-info {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .avatar {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      background-color: #fcd34d;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .user-text p {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .user-text h1 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .btn-new {
      background-color: #1a8ad2;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.5rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* 3. Main Content & Project Grid Styles */
    .main-content {
      grid-column: 2 / -1;
      padding: 2rem 3rem;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .main-content h2 {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .project-card {
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-left: 8px solid #f59e0b;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 180px;
    }
    .card-text h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    .card-text p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .card-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .card-actions span {
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .card-actions span:hover {
      color: #1a8ad2;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="logo">
        <span class="material-icons-outlined">dashboard</span>
        Dashboard
      </div>
      
      <nav class="nav-group">
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">home</span>Home</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">badge</span>Profile</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">chat</span>Messages</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">schedule</span>History</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">task</span>Tasks</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">groups</span>Communities</a>
      </nav>

      <nav class="nav-group">
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">settings</span>Settings</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">help_center</span>Support</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-item"><span class="material-icons-outlined">verified_user</span>Privacy</a>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <!-- Top Header -->
    <header class="header">
      <div class="header-top">
        <div class="search-bar">
          <span class="material-icons-outlined">search</span>
          <input type="text" aria-label="Search">
        </div>
        <div class="header-profile">
          <span class="material-icons-outlined">notifications_active</span>
          <div class="avatar" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; font-size: 1.2rem;">🐱</div>
          <strong>Morgan Oakley</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="header-bottom">
        <div class="user-info">
          <div class="avatar">🐱</div>
          <div class="user-text">
            <p>Hi there,</p>
            <h1>Morgan Oakley (@morgan)</h1>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-new">New</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="main-content">
      <h2>Your Projects</h2>
      
      <div class="projects-grid">
        
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>Super Cool Project</h3>
            <p>Sed tempus ut lacus ut scelerisque. Suspendisse sollicitudin nibh erat, id facilisis felis accumsan nec.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">star_border</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">visibility</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">account_tree</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>Less Cool Project</h3>
            <p>Nullam condimentum ipsum ut lectus vehicula consectetur. Quisque sed dolor tincidunt, consectetur sapien et, facilisis dolor. Duis sem purus, dignissim ut sapien in, varius pellentesque lacus.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">star_border</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">visibility</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">account_tree</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>Impossible App</h3>
            <p>In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Vivamus dictum rutrum arcu, a placerat velit sagittis id.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">star_border</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">visibility</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">account_tree</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>Easy Peasy App</h3>
            <p>Etiam cursus eros ac efficitur fringilla. Vestibulum dignissim urna eget accumsan aliquam. Curabitur dignissim nisi in tortor commodo, ac bibendum magna tincidunt.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">star_border</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">visibility</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">account_tree</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 5 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>Ad Blocker</h3>
            <p>Quisque eget rutrum nisl. Nam augue justo, cursus vitae metus vel, pharetra hendrerit felis. Aliquam sed malesuada eros.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">star_border</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">visibility</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">account_tree</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 6 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>Money Maker</h3>
            <p>Praesent convallis, libero quis congue elementum, nunc ante faucibus sapien, ac scelerisque tortor purus sit amet ex. Pellentesque mollis nec sem vel aliquam.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">star_border</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">visibility</span>
            <span class="material-icons-outlined">account_tree</span>
          </div>
        </article>
